\f1\b\fs36 Environment Commands\
\pard\tx360\tx720\tx1080\tx1440\tx1800\tx2160\tx2880\tx3600\tx4320\fi360\sl264\slmult1\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs24 \cf0 <!$Scr_H::1><!$Scr_Ps::0>
\f2\fs36 \
There is an "environment" of values that control different aspects of things. Some are legit BASIC commands, some are done via the device escape hatch of 
\f3 PRINT @1,2:3,4,5
\f2   where 1 is the device, 2 is the command to send to the device, and 3,4,5 (could be just one, could be more) are the parameters to that command.\
\
